  "title": "Deleting App Engine actions or a section tombstones their PeopleCode in PSPCMPROGDEL at the new PCM, SQL in PSSQLDEL at the new SRM, and a section in PSAESECTDEL at the new AES",
  "statement": "When App Designer deletes a PeopleCode action, a SQL action or a whole section, the program's PeopleCode rows go with a PSPCMPROGDEL row at the new PCM (PCM +1), the SQL definition's rows go with a PSSQLDEL row at the new SRM (SRM +1), and a deleted section leaves a PSAESECTDEL row at the new AES (not AEM), besides AEM, AES and SYS +1.",
